      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hi, I run a small online stationery shop based in Lyon and I'm a bit overwhelmed by GDPR. Can you give me a quick summary of the core principles I need to follow, specifically regarding how I handle customer email addresses and shipping info for orders? I have an audit coming up soon so I need to make sure I'm doing things right.",
