    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Thanks, that makes sense. One thing I'm worried about is data security—specifically the \"hidden\" risks. Like, if someone were to try and access our database or if there are vulnerabilities we can't see, how am I supposed to protect against those kinds of sneaky or unauthorized intrusions? What are the specific requirements for preventing that?",
