    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's helpful. I'm also concerned about unauthorized access from within the system, or maybe just little errors and small bits of data \"disappearing\" or being moved around without me knowing. It feels like there are these tiny, invisible ways things could go wrong. How does GDPR address those kinds of small-scale, stealthy breaches or data mismanagement?",
