      "content": "GDPR addresses these risks through the requirement for appropriate internal controls and data integrity. You must maintain accurate records of processing activities to know where all the data is and who can access it, which helps catch mismanagement. Furthermore, you should have defined procedures for logging access and ensuring prompt deletion or alteration of data when requested, minimizing the risk of small, unnoticed errors.",
